{"title":"Yeti Ravager","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 60 Yeti that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (2.1% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 6 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 9 recorded drops, 730 total, 24–284 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×24–284</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"yeti-fang\" title=\"Yeti Fang - in 5 of 6 looted corpses, 5 recorded drops, 7 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/b964f6987e786c9b807e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Yeti Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.2<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"yeti-hide\" title=\"Yeti Hide - in 2 of 6 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/978483ebfccb2cae6e0d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Yeti Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-feet\" title=\"Dragonscale Feet - in 1 of 6 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7ce6de157efd9abd04f5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/6<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1961.3px,385.0px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/6/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1536px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/7/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1792px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/8/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2048px;top:-512px\"><i style=\"left:1976.0px;top:-360.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1918.9px;top:-425.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1925.4px;top:-387.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1918.1px;top:-407.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1953.9px;top:-404.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1967.6px;top:-371.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1929.4px;top:-394.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1971.8px;top:-395.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:2051.7px;top:-366.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:2002.1px;top:-380.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:1905.3px;top:-396.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:2008.8px;top:-364.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1982.8px;top:-380.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:1907.9px;top:-382.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:1938.8px;top:-392.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1962.1px;top:-371.3px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 433, -994 <span class=\"muted\">· 18 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 211, -1041 <span class=\"muted\">· 8 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 233, -1045 <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 415, -973 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" d